# SEON

SEON is a unified platform for fraud prevention and AML compliance. It uses real-time data enrichment and risk scoring to identify high-risk users, detect money laundering and stop fraudulent transactions using 900+ first-party signals that you can't get anywhere else.

## Platform

-[SEON Platform](https://seon.io/): The AI-powered fraud prevention and AML platform to enrich data, understand context and take action from one place.

-[Real-Time Risk Signals](https://seon.io/products/real-time-risk-signals/): Accurately detect risk with the industry’s richest first-party dataset, including 900+ data signals that go deeper than any other platform.

-[AI & Machine Learning](https://seon.io/products/ai-machine-learning-solution/): Equip your team with explainable AI that reveals which of 900+ signals drive risk, flags false positives, maps suspicious networks and helps create rules, filters and regulatory reports faster. 

-[Case Management](https://seon.io/products/case-management/): Centralize investigations by seeing fraud and AML data in one place to make faster, more accurate decisions.


## Solutions

-[AML Compliance](https://seon.io/aml-compliance/): An AML compliance solution that automates operations by unifying fraud and AML data. Uses AI for SAR narrative generation and pre-screening to identify risk before formal KYC/AML workflows.

-[Customer Screening](https://seon.io/products/customer-screening/): A real-time customer screening tool for KYC funnels. Uses granular fuzzy matching and fresh global datasets to apply customizable risk profiles based on specific jurisdictional requirements.

-[AML Transaction Monitoring](https://seon.io/products/aml-transaction-monitoring/): AML transaction monitoring with context-aware risk detection. Uses no-code rules, velocity controls, and 900+ fraud signals to investigate suspicious financial activity in real time.

-[Payment Screening](https://seon.io/products/payment-screening/): Block high-risk payments in real time with granular logic. Screen senders, receivers, wallets, and bank IDs against direct sanctions lists to stop illicit funds before settlement.

-[Identity Verification](https://seon.io/products/identity-verification/): Context-driven KYC built on 900+ real-time fraud signals to verify identities based on behavior, not just documents, reducing friction for legitimate users and stopping synthetic and stolen identities earlier.

-[Liveness Detection](https://seon.io/products/liveness-detection/): Passive biometric verification that detects deepfakes, replays and spoofing attempts, enhanced with real-time fraud signals to confirm the person behind the identity is genuine.

-[Proof of Address](https://seon.io/products/proof-of-address/): AI-powered address verification that detects tampered or AI-generated documents. Validate residency with real-time fraud signals for authenticity in context, not in isolation.

-[Digital Footprint](https://seon.io/products/digital-footprint-solution/): Digital footprint analysis that enriches 900+ social and digital signals to validate player identity and assess risk intent.

-[Device Intelligence](https://seon.io/products/device-intelligence-solution/): Device intelligence solution using behavioral and hardware signals to identify bot-led fraud and ATO in real time.

-[Fraud Prevention](https://seon.io/products/fraud-prevention/): A fraud prevention solution using 900+ first-party signals and AI risk scoring to automate real-time decisions across the entire customer journey.


